<title>USA: Chase declines comment on Lehman rumors.</title>
<headline>Chase declines comment on Lehman rumors.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chase Manhattan Corp declined comment Wednesday on market rumors that it may acquire Lehman Brothers Holdings Inc.</p>
<p>&quot;As a matter of policy we don't comment on market rumors,&quot; a Chase spokesman said.</p>
<p>Lehman was up 4-3/4 to 38-7/8 in early afternoon. Chase Manhattan was off 1-1/4 to 97.</p>
</text>
